WEBVTT

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.320
Heine has resigned from
the post of royal tutor.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.310
Resigned?

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:12.600
Officially, he is the royal
tutor through tomorrow.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.110
This cannot be...

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.360
But what happened was a
misunderstanding, wasn't it?

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:21.910
It is a fact that he injured
guards and was jailed.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:30.260
If you were labeled as princes groomed
by a royal tutor with a criminal record,

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:35.180
it could potentially damage
your legitimacy as king.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:40.510
That's why if his past ever
came to light, he would leave.

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:43.140
He made this his condition to
prevent harming your futures.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:51.400
If you knew everything, why did you make
Heine Wittgenstein our royal tutor?

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.750
For the good of the kingdom.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.580
What do you mean?

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.020
Now, it's late.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.050
Tomorrow will be your
final lesson with Heine.

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:05.820
Go to bed.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:11.250
The Last Lesson

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.000
What do we do?

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.050
There's nothing we <i>can</i> do.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.260
You're okay with Heine leaving?!

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.890
I didn't say that!

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:19.180
Stop quarreling.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:25.020
I don't want Heine to leave, either.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.480
But what can we even do?

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:31.730
What?

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:16.450
Your Highnesses are early today.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:18.030
Professor...

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.030
We went to your room last night.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:25.700
I was out in town making preparations
for after I leave the palace.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.910
You're really resigning?

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.460
Yes.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:35.710
I will now begin my final lesson.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.640
It seems Your Highnesses
completed your assignment

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.550
to determine the truth behind
the tabloid article.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.720
I must say I didn't expect
you to track down the author

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.820
and threaten him into revealing it.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.990
Why do you know about that?!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.870
This is abhorrent behavior for princes.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:02.940
Master, why did you have us look into this?

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:07.120
The royal tutor before you
was a criminal all along.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.680
No, you're not a criminal!

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.300
He's right! We heard it happened
because of incorrect assumptions.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.380
You heard?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.500
Dad told us.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:22.180
Viktor... He promised me
he wouldn't tell a soul.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.380
Master, you are no criminal.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.510
Is that your answer?

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.270
Huh?

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:36.280
I believe I told you to make your
judgments as candidates for the throne.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:43.150
A criminal who was jailed has
now slipped into the palace.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.170
You're not...

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:49.160
Then do not think of it as me.
Answer only from the facts.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.120
What would you do if a man

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:55.160
with a criminal history had slipped
into the palace as the royal tutor?

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.120
What would you do?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:05.370
I would investigate him from all angles
to determine what sort of man he is.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:07.120
Is that all?

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.680
I would... kick him out of the palace.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.480
That is correct. Well done.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.060
Don't forget to get to
the bottom of the truth

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:21.030
and make decisions without
being blinded by emotions.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:21.950
Heine!

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.500
Heine, are you okay with this?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:32.250
Do not worry.
I have not slipped into the palace.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:36.490
I am here by request of the king,
and my goal is no secret.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:40.050
I am here to groom Your Highnesses into
worthy candidates for the throne.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:49.220
I'm a dunce. I don't get it. Why are you...?

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.470
Indeed, you are a dunce, Prince Leonhard.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:53.130
Hey!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:00.560
However, you are very clever
to know it yourself.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.450
Prince Leonhard, you were running
from the things you did not like.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.040
I even chased you as you fled on horseback.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:14.330
You have the strength to see your
own weaknesses and conquer them.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.590
Moreover, you possess a more powerful
imagination than any other.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.550
If you become king,

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:28.760
I know you could save the kingdom from
danger with that strength and imagination.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:29.890
Heine...

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.560
Prince Licht.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.690
You appear to be a playboy,
but you are very serious, aren't you?

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.770
Stop saying that.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.270
Honestly, you were quite a handful.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:47.740
Yet I've become partial to a
kapuziner with a Dobos torte.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:54.680
You don't boast about being a royal.
You treat everyone equally.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.080
You can listen to their stories.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.370
That is an excellent gift.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.790
If you become king,

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:07.800
you would create a kind kingdom that would
reach out to anyone without discrimination.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.270
Professor...

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.510
Prince Bruno.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.300
Y-Yes, sir!

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:17.630
I know that you toil harder than anyone.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.770
Master...

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.390
You kept calling me that until
the very end, didn't you?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.900
You never neglect to put forth the
effort to learn, in any circumstance.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.160
You've started to be able to
impart your knowledge to others.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:34.160
You have the ability to judge
situations and make decisions, too.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:39.710
The time you spent lost and agonizing
will surely become your strength.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:44.170
I believe you have grown the most.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:53.760
If you become king, I'm sure you
could lead this kingdom correctly.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.430
Master...

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:58.970
Prince Kai.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:06.730
When I first arrived, everyone feared you.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:11.030
But now there is not a soul in the
palace who would say you are scary.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.740
Although your intense love of
soft things can be a problem...

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:20.080
You have the strength to keep moving
forward in the face of any difficulty,

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.380
and an understanding heart.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.540
That will be your greatest weapon.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:29.410
If you become king, I know you could use
that weapon to protect this kingdom

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:33.010
and give your subjects peace of mind.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.680
Professor...

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:41.310
I became the royal tutor to
turn each of you into a king.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:45.060
A heart that listens to
the voices of the people.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.560
An incomparable imagination and

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.860
a wealth of information
that can lead everyone.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.870
If you have the strength
to overcome difficulties,

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.080
this kingdom has a bright future.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:11.260
Thus ends my lessons.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.050
P-Professor!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:21.100
I am no longer Your Highnesses' professor.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.060
Goodbye.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.320
You were too good.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:39.030
With you around, the princes really
would become fit for the throne.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.580
Well, the one who will be
crowned king is Prince Eins.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:46.420
Farewell, Professor Heine.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.010
Father?

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.060
Dad!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:05.350
Sometimes I want to come see my sons' faces.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.230
You don't look very cheerful.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.060
Soon, a new royal tutor will be coming.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.280
A new royal tutor?

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.740
Yes. They'll be chosen at the council
the day after tomorrow.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.830
You aren't choosing, Father?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.010
I can't think of a tutor who
would be fit for you boys.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:29.890
The counts should propose an
excellent royal tutor at the council.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.470
Is Heine not coming back?

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:34.570
Your Majesty.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.910
I hope the new royal tutor comes quickly.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:54.190
I don't want a new royal tutor.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.860
The counts are going to choose?

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.280
They're just going to pick a jerk like the
tutors we had before Professor Heine.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.730
I cannot tolerate this.

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:05.000
Bruno?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:11.490
I cannot tolerate how I accepted
Master's departure so easily.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.380
Surely there was something
we could have done.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:21.260
They should just let <i>us</i>
choose our royal tutor.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.850
There's no one more fit
for the post than Heine.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.310
That's it!

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:26.900
Huh?

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:31.940
Father said the royal tutor would be chosen
at the council in two days, right?

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:35.120
That means they haven't chosen anyone yet.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:38.070
Do we have the right to choose?

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:38.840
No.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:42.570
However, we should have the
right to speak at the council.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.330
If we nominate a fitting person...

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.500
I get it.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.150
Yeah.

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:49.790
Huh? The right? What?

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:52.080
Am I the only one who doesn't get it?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.040
This isn't fair!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.040
Sheesh.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:59.300
Basically, we just have to prove that
Professor Heine's perfect for the post.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.630
Yes. What does it mean to be royal tutor?

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:03.680
Huh?

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:11.460
The royal tutor is an exclusive home tutor
who grooms princes into worthy kings.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.480
Worthy kings...

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:19.700
Then if we show them that we're
growing into worthy kings...

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.620
It's worth an attempt.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.740
Better than nothing.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:24.820
Yeah.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.000
We'll do it!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:27.620
Yeah!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.860
Wait!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.610
Play safely, now.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.740
Come on, come on!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.370
Who are you, mister?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.710
I'm a friend of Professor Heine.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:22.010
Should you be here alone?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.430
My escort is waiting outside.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.760
Don't worry.
I didn't sneak out like I used to.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.850
How may I help you?

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:34.440
This afternoon, there will be a council
meeting to decide on the royal tutor.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.350
A meeting? Don't you decide on this post?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:43.980
I can't think of anyone fit
for it anymore, besides you.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.990
I am not fit for the post at all.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.740
Heine.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.650
Did you forget our dream?

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.170
One day, you'll all have
a warm place to sleep,

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:03.880
you'll never want for food,
and you'll have equal access to education.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.850
I want to make this a prosperous
and peaceful nation.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.350
When that happens, Heine, will you help me?

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.770
You say some funny things.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.770
Are you planning on becoming
king or something?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:17.330
Well, if I could live in a dreamland
like that, I'd do anything.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.940
I won't let this kingdom fall
into such poverty again.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.070
To that end, I can't leave my throne to a man

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.910
who would abuse his authority to
protect the privilege of nobles.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.290
The education of the princes
is extremely important.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:37.550
Meeting you allowed me to
change this kingdom, Heine.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.950
And meeting you has caused a
great change in my sons, too.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:48.260
Before, they were pampered princes
who only thought of themselves.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:53.720
Which is precisely why I don't want to
tarnish their futures with my past.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.610
It's almost time for the council. I must go.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:04.850
That reminds me. It seems my sons are
scheming to do something at the council.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.610
Scheming?

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.690
What are they planning?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.950
You'll find out if you come to see.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.160
I won't go. Please stop them
from doing anything foolish.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.710
Did you come here just to
tell me that? I will not go.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.770
Heine. I was glad to be
able to see you again.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:34.680
He graduated at the top of his class from
Glanzreich University's politics department,

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.890
and went on to obtain a doctorate
in political economics there.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:43.730
He's also tutored the sons of
dukes in our neighboring nations.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:49.750
I nominate Dr. Erwin von Welsbach
for the post of royal tutor.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:55.700
This Dr. Erwin, isn't he the son
of Count Gerhard von Welsbach?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.500
He is. Are you acquainted?

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.750
An excellent nomination.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.140
There should be no issue
leaving the princes to him.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:10.390
If this rigid fellow agrees,
it may as well be set in stone.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:14.970
If the new royal tutor is someone
I can control as I please,

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.270
I can control the four princes, too.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.390
Are there any other nominations
for royal tutor?

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:28.530
Then let's bring it to a vote.
All in favor of Dr. Erwin von Welsbach—

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.020
Wait!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.990
Your Highnesses?!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.840
We have someone we'd like to nominate.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:42.580
You boys don't have the right
to choose the royal tutor.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:47.710
Father! We only want to introduce
someone who's fit for the post.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.700
Just hear us out! Please, Dad!

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:53.180
I am not your father here.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.730
I am your king.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.720
Your Majesty, perhaps we should
at least hear them out?

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.980
It's the chairman's decision.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.110
If the princes wish it, very well.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:14.030
But know that the council will vote fairly,
even with someone the princes nominate.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.620
Thank you.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:21.790
They're still only children.
Let them shame and sabotage themselves.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:31.790
We would like to nominate Heine Wittgenstein
for the post of royal tutor.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.420
Heine?

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.880
Isn't he the tutor who resigned?

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:38.880
We'd like to welcome him
as royal tutor again.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.930
I understand that Your
Highnesses were attached,

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:46.490
but didn't Heine Wittgenstein resign
because of suspicions about his past?

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.020
Suspicions?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:50.600
There were rumors about a criminal record.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.990
A man with a criminal record as royal tutor?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.350
Unacceptable!

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:57.160
Then His Majesty fired him for that?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:17:01.160
They're only rumors! Please listen to us.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.040
Order!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.510
Why would you nominate this man?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.790
Heine Wittgenstein is an exceptional tutor.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.520
Where did he go to university?

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.040
He did not.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.170
Then there's nothing to discuss.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:27.360
The royal tutor is an important post.
This is the man who will groom our king.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:30.400
How could a criminal with no degree do it?

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.320
Excuse me?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:37.560
Even if they're only rumors,
choosing a man like that would be outrageous.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:42.540
I think <i>you're</i> outrageous for jumping
to conclusions based on rumors alone.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.740
Leonhard!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.330
Your Highnesses,

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:50.240
you would do well to be a little more aware
of your position as heirs to the throne.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.200
It's over.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.070
Now what?

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.800
At this rate...

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.280
Professor...

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:06.780
Heine...

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.220
You need a lesson.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.210
We're doing this because we're aware of
our position as heirs to the throne.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:25.330
Everyone has a mark or two on their past.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.540
Are you any different?

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:32.880
It's a mistake to judge
someone from only one angle.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:38.680
As king, a single error in judgment
could lose you the entire country.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:43.420
That's why we can't afford to
make the wrong decision here.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:48.920
We're thinking of the kingdom's
future as its heirs.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:52.680
People will be misunderstood
and get hurt. But...

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.660
This is a large kingdom in a wide world.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:59.780
There must be tens of thousands
of people who can understand you.

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:02.280
I don't want them to lose hope.

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:06.600
I want them to be able to follow
their ambitions and enjoy freedom.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:11.830
Before quitting something you want to do,
you should explore alternative solutions.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.580
To be able to choose
their own paths in life.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:19.780
Sometimes they might choose
the wrong path, but...

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:22.260
You have only one life,
and it is yours alone.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.350
Do you need a reason to
live it as you please?

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.600
I want to make our kingdom
one where you can start over again,

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.600
rather than one where you hesitate to choose
a path because it could be a mistake.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:35.760
Compassion for others.
Reaching out to the weak.

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:40.180
Those who know their own
vulnerability can grow to be

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:43.560
stout-hearted people who are kind
and sensitive to others' pain.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.490
I want to make our kingdom one
where we all help each other.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:52.420
We started thinking like this
because of Heine, the royal tutor.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:59.130
Now and forever, we want a nation where
everyone has a warm place to sleep...

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.210
Where no one will want for food...

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.810
Where there is equal access to education.

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:50.810
Count Rosenberg.

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:52.340
Your Majesty.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:56.160
The princes caused a bother, eh?

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:59.910
The royal tutor you introduced was perfect.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.070
You honor me.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:03.580
Father.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.190
Prince Eins!

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.490
Eins! You're back?

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.360
Yes. I'll report on my
diplomatic trip later.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:13.250
Very good.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:16.580
But I really am surprised.

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:22.140
I thought my brothers were still children,
but they've matured this much.

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:23.970
Were you watching?

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:27.800
I never thought I'd hear them
speak about the kingdom's future.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.920
Yes. I was surprised, too.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:31.730
Your Majesty.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.310
It's time for the vote. Excuse me.

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.300
Ernst.

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.810
Keep your nose out of this.

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:41.910
Y-Yes, Your Highness.

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:49.310
Don't worry. I'll be the one to become king.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:51.810
Through my own power.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:07.390
Boring day after boring day...

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:08.330
You fool!

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:12.300
Also, today's a special day.
We're to welcome the new royal tutor.

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:14.580
Oh, yeah!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:16.720
The one who'll be coming is...

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:40.740
I am honored to meet you, Your Highnesses.

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:43.820
As of today, I am Your Highnesses'

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.180
royal tutor.

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:00.430
Welcome to Weissburg Palace.

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:10.040
We're so happy to have you here,

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:13.100
Professor Heine.

00:23:20.110 --> 00:23:23.140
Now, let us begin your lesson.
